            "sid": "NEH 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago nugo mabara ga banyakatagara n'Abaleevi abaizire hamu na Zerubbabbeeri mutabani wa Seyarutyeri na Yeswa: Seraya, Yeremiya, Ezira, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amariya, Maluki, Hatusi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sekaniya, Rehumu, Meremoosi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ido, Ginesooyi, Abiya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Miyamiini, Maadia, Biriga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Semaaya, Yoyalibu, Yedaaya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saalu, Amoki, Hirikiya, na Yedaaya. Abo nubo bakaba bali bakuru ba banyakatagara, n'abagenzi baabo, omu businge bwa Yeswa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago nugo amabara g'Abaleevi: Yeswa, Binwi, Kadimyeri, Serebiya, Yuda, na Mataniya ayaroleerraga hamu na bagenzi be abazini abaazinaga ebizina eby'okusiima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakibukia na Uno bagenzi baabo, omu bwire bw'okusoma, baayemerraga barorangaine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeswa nuwe yazaaraga Yoyakimu, Yoyakimu kizaara Eryasibbu, Eryasibbu kizaara Yoyada, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoyada kizaara Yonasani, Yonasani kizaara Yaduwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu biro bya Yoyakimu, hakaba haroho banyakatagara, bakuru b'amaju ga baisenkurubo: ow'enju ya Seraaya, nuwe Meraaya, ow'eya Yeremiya, nuwe Hananiya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "owa Ezira nuwe Mesulaamu, ow'ey'Amariya Yehohanani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ow'eya Maluki, nuwe Yonasaani, owa Sebaniya nuwe Yozefu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "owa Harimu nuwe Aduna, owa Merayosi nuwe Herekayi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "owa Ido, nuwe Zekaliya, owa Ginesooyi nuwe Mesulaamu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ow'ey'Abiya nuwe Zikiri, ow'eya Minyamiini owa Mowadiya, nuwe Piritayi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "owa Biriga nuwe Samuwa, owa Semaaya, nuwe Yehonasani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "owa Yoyaribbu, nuwe Matenayi, owa Yedaaya nuwe Uzi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "owa Salayi, nuwe Kaliya, ow'Amoki, nuwe Ebberi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "owa Hirikiya, nuwe Hasabiya, kandi owa Yedaaya, nuwe Netaneeri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebirukubaza ha Baleevi: Omu busumi bwa Eryasibbu, Yoyada, Yohanani na Yaduwa, hakaba haroho ekihandiiko eky'ebitabu by'Abaleevi n'ekya baanyakatagara, okuhika omu kasumi ka Daliya Omupaasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batabani b'Abaleevi, abakuru b'amaju ga baisenkurubo, baahandiikwaga omu kitabu eky'obusinge bw'abakama, okuhika ha businge bwa Yohanani mutabani w'Eryasibbu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago nugo amabara aga bakuru b'Abaleevi: Hasabiya, Serebbiya na Yeswa mutabani wa Kadimyeri, na bagenzi baabo abaakozire ekitebe ky'abazini ab'okuzina ebizina eby'okukugiza n'okusiima omu mbu Daudi omwiru wa Ruhanga nkooku yaragiire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mataniya, Bakibbukiya, Obadiya, Mesuraamu, Tarumooni n'Akubbu, nubo bakaba bali balinzi abaalindaga amaahurro aga ha malembo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo bakabaho omu busumi bwa Yoyakimu mutabani wa Yeswa, mwijukuru wa Yozadaaki, n'omu bwa Nehemiya omulemi omukuru, n'omu bw'Ezira nyakatagara kandi omuhandiiki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kasumi ak'okweza ekisiika ekya Yerusaalemu, bakaserra Abaleevi omu biikaro byabo byona babaleete Yerusaalemu, basemeze n'omuhimbo omukoro ogw'okweza ekisiika, nibasiima nibazina nibatera ebitaasa, endongo n'enanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batabani b'abazini, bakaruga omu biikaro bakaba bali, n'omu byaro bya Abanetofa ebyehinguliriize Yerusaalemu, baayeteeraniza hamu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi bakaruga Besi-girigali n'omu kicweka ky'ensi Gebba n'Azimavesi; habwokuba abazini bakaba beetembuliire ebyaro okwehinguliriza Yerusaalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baanyakatagara n'Abaleevi, bakeeyeza, baayeza n'abantu, amalembo n'ekisiika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
