          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha kiro eki, nubwo haakomerwe abantu ab'okurolerra ebisiika eby'amaahurro ag'okwahuramu: ebihongwa, emiganuro, ebicweka eby'ikumi, ab'okusoroolezaamuga emigabo eyerukuragirwa omu biragiro ey'okukonyera b'anyakatagara, n'Abaleevi, ey'erukwingana emisiri ey'omu mbuga; habwokuba Ab'ayuda bakasiima b'anyakatagara n'Abaleevi abakaba nibabaheereza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
